mises network that communicates with Microsoft Entra ID, enabling remote us=
ers to access internal apps like <em>WebApp1</em> using SSO while off-netwo=
rk.</p><p><br></p><p><code><strong>Microsoft Entra Identity Management (PIM=
)</strong></code> is <strong>incorrect</strong> because Privileged Identity=
 Management (PIM) is used to manage, control, and monitor access to importa=
nt resources by providing just-in-time privileged access. It is not related=
