tables is more closely associated with dedicated SQL pools (formerly SQL Da=
ta Warehouse). In comparison, dedicated SQL pools support the creation of h=
ash-distributed tables, where data is distributed across multiple nodes bas=
ed on a hash function. The serverless Apache Spark pool, on the other hand,=
 is better suited for ad-hoc querying, exploration, and processing of data =
