is of Big Data within seconds to minutes, depending on the workload. The sy=
stem's built-in query execution fault-tolerance ensures high reliability an=
d success rates, even for extensive and long-running queries involving larg=
e datasets. The key advantage lies in its serverless nature, eliminating th=
e need for infrastructure setup or maintenance. Each Azure Synapse workspac=
e includes a default endpoint, so you can start querying data as soon as th=
e workspace is created. Importantly, the serverless SQL pool doesn't suppor=
