retrieve data stored in the Delta Lake format, making it handy for reportin=
g tools. This pool is flexible and capable of reading Delta Lake files gene=
rated by Apache Spark, Azure Databricks, or any other platform using the De=
lta Lake format. This flexibility makes it the best option for querying and=
 serving data from Delta Lake across different data processing and analytic=
s environments. However, it's important to note that, considering the speci=
fied requirement of updating data, it may not be suitable.<br></p><p><code>=
<strong>A dedicated SQL pool</strong></code> is <strong>incorrect</strong>.=
 A dedicated SQL pool (formerly known as SQL Data Warehouse in Azure Synaps=
