security numbers, Column Encryption may lack the necessary granularity. It =
is indeed possible to encrypt specific columns using Column Encryption. But=
 the encryption process involves the management of encryption keys. Conside=
ring Always Encrypted is the best choice by enabling the application to man=
age the keys. While Column Encryption is effective for various use cases, c=
onsidering requirements, such as preventing cloud administrators from acces=
sing certain sensitive data, may not be the ideal choice.<br></p><p><code><=
